Text Only<pre><code>&lt;header&gt;
&lt;BLANK LINE&gt;
&lt;body&gt;
&lt;BLANK LINE&gt;
&lt;footer&gt;
</code></pre> <p>The <code>&lt;header&gt;</code> is mandatory and must conform to the Commit Message Header format.</p> <p>The <code>&lt;body&gt;</code> is mandatory for all commits except for those of type "docs". When the body is present it must be at least 20 characters long and must conform to the Commit Message Body format.</p> <p>The <code>&lt;footer&gt;</code> is optional. The Commit Message Footer format describes what the footer is used for and the structure it must have.</p>
